{"seq":3,"slug":"promo-abuse-loss-measurement","title":"滥用损失归因与度量口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/promo-abuse-taxonomy-economics/promo-abuse-loss-measurement","wordCount":3131,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"滥用损失归因与度量口径\">滥用损失归因与度量口径</h1><p>东南亚首单立减活动结束当天，负责人报出「券核销 GMV 增长 40%」——数据是真的。三天后财务在月结时问了另一个问题：这场活动花掉 62 万补贴预算，其中多少买到了增量新客，多少落进了同一批地址的复购？两个部门用同一套数据库，却给出互相矛盾的结论。分歧不在数字，在<strong>口径</strong>：一方数核销金额，一方要的是归因到滥用的沉没成本。度量促销滥用的第一道工序，是把这笔钱在一张图上放对位置——谁花的、花在哪个环节、何时可确认为损失。本章承接前两篇的<a href=\"promo-abuse-taxonomy-attacker-archetypes\">分类与画像</a>与<a href=\"promo-attack-economics-roi-model\">攻击 ROI 模型</a>，推进到可入账、可复盘的度量层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三本账错位与损失归因链\">核心概念：三本账错位与损失归因链</h2><p>促销滥用的损失之所以难度量，根因是同一笔支出在三本账上被记录成三种东西，而没有任何一本账天然承认「这是损失」。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>财务账</strong>把券看作价格折让（discount），计入收入抵减，券一旦核销就与正常折扣无从区分。</li>\n<li><strong>风控账</strong>只承认拒付（chargeback）与盗卡损失，促销套利不产生拒付，因此在风控口径下金额为零。</li>\n<li><strong>运营账</strong>看到的是履约成本上升、客服工单增加、活动预算提前耗尽，但它没有能力判断哪一单是滥用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>归因</strong>（attribution）就是在这三本账之间建立可追溯的映射：把一个账号的每次权益获取，连同它触发的履约、支付、售后成本，落到同一个「滥用事件」上，再决定这笔支出是沉没、追回还是可回收。归因链的每个环节都可能漏计：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;活动发布&lt;br/&gt;预算 B 拨备&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;权益发放&lt;br/&gt;领券/发码&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;核销判定&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;正常核销&quot;| D[&quot;记为价格折让&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;滥用核销&quot;| E[&quot;记为滥用损失&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;直接损失&lt;br/&gt;券面值 + 补贴&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;间接损失&lt;br/&gt;履约 + 支付 + 售后&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; H[&quot;机会成本&lt;br/&gt;预算挤占真实新客&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; I[&quot;归因汇总&lt;br/&gt;abuse loss&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J{&quot;可追回?&quot;}&#10;  J --&gt;|&quot;可撤销/回收&quot;| K[&quot;净损失&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt;|&quot;已履约沉没&quot;| K\">graph TD\n  A[\"活动发布&lt;br/&gt;预算 B 拨备\"] --&gt; B[\"权益发放&lt;br/&gt;领券/发码\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"核销判定\"}\n  C --&gt;|\"正常核销\"| D[\"记为价格折让\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"滥用核销\"| E[\"记为滥用损失\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"直接损失&lt;br/&gt;券面值 + 补贴\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"间接损失&lt;br/&gt;履约 + 支付 + 售后\"]\n  E --&gt; H[\"机会成本&lt;br/&gt;预算挤占真实新客\"]\n  F --&gt; I[\"归因汇总&lt;br/&gt;abuse loss\"]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J{\"可追回?\"}\n  J --&gt;|\"可撤销/回收\"| K[\"净损失\"]\n  J --&gt;|\"已履约沉没\"| K</pre><p>度量口径本身需要先定义清楚，否则「滥用率」在不同团队间会漂移成不同的数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>分母口径</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>券面值损失 <code>L_face</code></td>\n<td>滥用账号核销的券面值总额</td>\n<td>全部核销券</td>\n<td>忽略未核销但已发放的券</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净补贴损失 <code>L_net</code></td>\n<td>面值 − 该单贡献毛利 + 履约净成本</td>\n<td>滥用订单</td>\n<td>把正常购买也计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滥用率 <code>abuse_rate</code></td>\n<td>滥用订单数 / 总订单数</td>\n<td>参与活动人群</td>\n<td>用全站订单作分母</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算泄漏率 <code>leak_rate</code></td>\n<td>滥用损失 / 活动总预算</td>\n<td>活动预算</td>\n<td>与核销率混淆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检出精确率 <code>precision</code></td>\n<td>真滥用 / 被拦截</td>\n<td>被拦截账号</td>\n<td>未复核即宣称</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拦截召回率 <code>recall</code></td>\n<td>真滥用被拦截 / 全部真滥用</td>\n<td>标签全集</td>\n<td>标签不全导致虚高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得注意，未核销的券并非「没有损失」，而是损失尚未落到另一个科目上。IFRS 15（客户合同收入）专门处理「客户未行使的权利」（unexercised rights，即 breakage），要求主体按预期不会被行使的比例确认收入并调整合同负债；同一批未核销券在财务上既可能是未来损失，也可能是被释放的收入——度量口径必须与会计口径对齐，否则风控的「损失」会与财务的「收入」互相抵消成噪声。</p>\n<h2 id=\"直接损失-券面值-净补贴与三个归因时点\">直接损失：券面值、净补贴与三个归因时点</h2><p>直接损失的基本形式是券面值，但真正入账的应该是<strong>净补贴</strong>。对一个券面值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>、订单金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>、毛利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的滥用订单：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>pay</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{net}} = v + c_{\\text{ship}} + c_{\\text{pay}} - m \\cdot G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pay</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{ship}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为平台承担的履约成本（跨境还要叠加关税预付与退货险），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>pay</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{pay}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pay</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为支付通道手续费。当订单最终退款时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{ship}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按往返计、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\cdot G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 归零，损失反而扩大——这正是「退款留赠」手法让单笔损失翻倍的算术来源。</p>\n<p>归因时点的选择决定了损失的可见速度，三个口径各有用途：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归因时点</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发放时点（claim-time）</td>\n<td>券进入账户</td>\n<td>最早可见，可用于实时护栏</td>\n<td>高估：未核销券未必使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核销时点（redeem-time）</td>\n<td>订单使用券</td>\n<td>与财务口径最接近</td>\n<td>滞后，预算可能已烧完</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算时点（settlement-time）</td>\n<td>交易完结/退货期结束</td>\n<td>最准确，含追回</td>\n<td>延迟数周，难用于处置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成熟团队通常同时维护三套数：发放时点驱动护栏、核销时点驱动复盘、结算时点驱动对账。只维护一套必然在某个环节失明——只有核销口径看不见「领了不用的券」被批量囤积以等待叠加窗口；只有发放口径则会把正常用户的未使用券算成损失，虚报出吓人的数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"间接损失-履约-支付与卡组织成本\">间接损失：履约、支付与卡组织成本</h2><p>间接损失是把促销滥用与支付欺诈混在一起度量的地方，也是财务口径最容易漏掉的部分。跨境场景的间接成本项至少包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>履约</strong>：真实发出的商品成本与双向物流。用虚假地址收货时物流费照付；用真实地址后申请退货时，往返运费由平台承担。</li>\n<li><strong>支付</strong>：通道手续费照收，触发拒付还要叠加退单费。卡组织监控计划会对高拒付商户追加惩罚性费用——Visa 的收单机构监控计划（VAMP）与 Mastercard 的欺诈监控项目均以商户拒付率与欺诈率为阈值，超阈值产生固定罚金并可能强制整改。</li>\n<li><strong>售后与人力</strong>：滥用订单的客服工单率、纠纷率、账号申诉成本显著高于正常订单。</li>\n<li><strong>预算挤占</strong>：被薅走的预算本可买到的真实增量新客。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>行业研究长期观察到欺诈损失的「总成本乘数」现象：LexisNexis Risk Solutions 的《True Cost of Fraud》系列连续多年测算，零售业每 1 美元欺诈损失连带产生约 3 美元以上的总成本，涵盖运营、替换、人力与声誉。促销滥用没有拒付这条链，它的乘数主要落在客服工单、活动复盘与预算重排上——<strong>不体现为拒付，因此更难被财务口径看见</strong>。度量时必须显式把这几项从「运营费用」里摘出来，否则归因结果系统性低估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量分层-从-gmv-折扣率到滥用率\">度量分层：从 GMV 折扣率到滥用率</h2><p>直接与间接损失是「钱」，滥用率是「比例」，两者回答不同问题。一个可用的度量体系应当分层。预算泄漏率定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>leak_rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext><mtext>abuse</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mtext>indirect</mtext><mtext>abuse</mtext></msubsup></mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>campaign</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{leak\\_rate} = \\frac{L_{\\text{net}}^{\\text{abuse}} + L_{\\text{indirect}}^{\\text{abuse}}}{B_{\\text{campaign}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">leak_rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4982em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">campaign</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">abuse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">indirect</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">abuse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>campaign</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{campaign}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">campaign</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是活动拨备预算。<code>leak_rate</code> 回答「这次活动有多少钱没花在正途」，但它是<strong>事后</strong>指标；用于护栏的应是它的实时代理量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>leak_rate</mtext><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>spent</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\text{leak\\_rate}}(t) = \\frac{\\sum_{i \\in \\mathcal{A}_t} v_i}{B_{\\text{spent}}(t)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2679em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">leak_rate</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.31em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5119em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5398em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">spent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7898em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3998em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是截至时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 被判定为滥用的订单集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>spent</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{spent}}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">spent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是已核销预算。这个代理量让护栏能在预算被烧穿前踩刹车，代价是把判定误差直接传导进度量——<strong>检测的精确率就是度量的精确率</strong>，这正是召回/精确必须与损失口径同时汇报的原因。</p>\n<p>度量体系还必须区分「检出损失」与「总损失」。被拦截的滥用不产生损失，若不补全标签，<code>leak_rate</code> 会随拦截能力提升而下降，看起来像攻击减少；实际可能是攻击被推出了可见范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因标签的来源与偏差校正\">归因标签的来源与偏差校正</h2><p>损失归因的可靠性完全取决于「哪些账号确实是滥用」这个标签从哪来。工程上只有三种来源，各有偏差：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标签来源</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>覆盖</th>\n<th>偏差方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>确定性证据</td>\n<td>同一设备指纹/卡 BIN/地址聚类被人工确认</td>\n<td>只覆盖高置信案例</td>\n<td>系统性漏掉低调攻击者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工抽样复核</td>\n<td>分层随机抽样 + 专家判读</td>\n<td>全量无偏</td>\n<td>成本高，样本小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型推断</td>\n<td>风控模型打分 + 对抗验证</td>\n<td>覆盖广</td>\n<td>与模型同源，自我印证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>只用确定性证据会让滥用率被低估到只剩「已被抓的」；只用模型推断则让度量变成对模型自己的评价。正确做法是<strong>用分层抽样校准模型</strong>：按模型分数量分层，每层随机抽若干账号做人工复核，估计真实滥用比例后加权回到全量。这样得到无偏的滥用率，而模型只用于排序与处置。</p>\n<p>当滥用群体存在未被观测的部分时，可用捕获-再捕获（capture-recapture）估计总量：设两个近似独立的检出机制（如设备图谱与行为模型）各自检出集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_1, S_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则总规模估计为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{N} = \\frac{|S_1| \\cdot |S_2|}{|S_1 \\cap S_2|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>该式只在两机制近似独立时成立——现实中设备图谱与行为模型常共享特征，会显著低估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。应把它当作下界而非点估计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量陷阱与误报成本\">度量陷阱与误报成本</h2><p>三个反复出现的口径错误会让整个归因结果失去决策价值：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，把误伤计入损失。</strong> 拦截正常用户产生的成本（客服申诉、用户流失、补偿券）是<strong>防御成本</strong>，不是滥用损失。混在一起会让「拦截越多损失越大」的荒谬结论成立。两个科目必须在报表上分列：<code>abuse_loss</code> 与 <code>defense_cost</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，分母口径漂移。</strong> 滥用率的分母应是「参与活动人群」而非「全站订单」。用全站作分母会把针对特定活动的攻击稀释到看不见，同时让活动人群基数小的活动显得滥用率畸高，导致预算被错误惩罚。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，幸存者偏差。</strong> 已封禁账号不再产生数据，若用「当前活跃账号」做分母回溯历史，会得出攻击正在减少的假象。度量必须使用<strong>事发时点的快照</strong>，而非当前状态表。</p>\n<p>合规口径同样是度量的约束。美国联邦贸易委员会关于消费者评论与推荐的规则（16 CFR Part 465，2024 年 8 月 22 日发布于《联邦公报》89 FR 68077，2024 年 10 月 21 日生效）禁止虚假评论、评论压制与买卖虚假影响力指标；英国《数字市场、竞争与消费者法》（DMCC Act 2024，2024 年 5 月 24 日获御准）将虚假评论与不公平商业行为纳入执法范围。与促销滥用同源的「刷单买评」因此还可能转化为合规罚则，度量体系应为其保留独立损失科目。身份侧基线参考 NIST SP 800-63-4《数字身份指南》（2025 年 7 月 31 日发布，取代 800-63-3），其身份保证等级（IAL/AAL/FAL）是判定账号可信度的外部锚点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>促销滥用的损失度量，本质是在财务、风控、运营三本账之间建立可追溯的归因映射，而非估一个总数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三本账错位</strong>是度量失败的根因：财务看到折让、风控看不到拒付、运营看到了成本却认不出滥用。</li>\n<li><strong>直接损失用净补贴口径</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>pay</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{net}} = v + c_{\\text{ship}} + c_{\\text{pay}} - m \\cdot G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pay</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，按发放、核销、结算三个时点分别维护，分别驱动护栏、复盘与对账。</li>\n<li><strong>间接损失不是零</strong>：履约、支付、卡组织监控罚金、客服与预算挤占共同构成总成本；行业研究显示零售业欺诈总成本约为直接损失的 3 倍以上。</li>\n<li><strong>比例指标要分层</strong>：<code>leak_rate</code> 用于事后，实时代理量用于护栏；精确率与召回率必须与损失口径同时汇报。</li>\n<li><strong>标签偏差必须校正</strong>：分层抽样校准模型，捕获-再捕获给出下界而非点估计。</li>\n<li><strong>科目必须分列</strong>：<code>abuse_loss</code> 与 <code>defense_cost</code> 分开，否则「拦截越多损失越大」的假象会误导决策；分母用活动人群、时点用事发快照。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>度量的终点不是更精确的报表，而是让每次预算护栏的调参都有可回滚的因果依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"滥用损失归因与度量口径","id":"滥用损失归因与度量口径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三本账错位与损失归因链","id":"核心概念-三本账错位与损失归因链"},{"level":2,"text":"直接损失：券面值、净补贴与三个归因时点","id":"直接损失-券面值-净补贴与三个归因时点"},{"level":2,"text":"间接损失：履约、支付与卡组织成本","id":"间接损失-履约-支付与卡组织成本"},{"level":2,"text":"度量分层：从 GMV 折扣率到滥用率","id":"度量分层-从-gmv-折扣率到滥用率"},{"level":2,"text":"归因标签的来源与偏差校正","id":"归因标签的来源与偏差校正"},{"level":2,"text":"度量陷阱与误报成本","id":"度量陷阱与误报成本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"薅羊毛攻击经济学与 ROI 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/promo-abuse-taxonomy-economics/promo-attack-economics-roi-model"},"next":{"title":"叠加资格、互斥与优先级规则建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/coupon-stack-rule-budget-engine/coupon-stack-eligibility-mutual-exclusion"}}